    "directions": [
      "Wash the beetroots and cut off the tops.",
      "Peel the skin (or you can peel it once cooked) and cut into chunks.",
      "Boil them in plenty of water for about 35 minutes (depending on its size, it could be a little longer). It is cooked when you pierce it easily with a skewer.",
      "To make the dressing, combine the extra virgin olive oil, balsamic vinegar and lemon juice in a small bowl.",
      "Season with salt and ground black pepper and mix well.",
      "Mix the rocket (or salad leaves of your choice) with the cooked beetroot in a serving dish.",
      "Pour the dressing over the top and mix well."
